 Physical footprint supplements RSS. It does not replace sampled peak RSS or its repeatability control. Reusable memory is not available through this unprivileged cross-process probe. The work totals, native pools, engine panel, twins, output checks, memory ceiling, and CPU, elapsed-time, and RSS allowances are unchanged. A smoke run cannot qualify comparative performance.
+
+## Explain counter work without adjusting timings
+
+Use the [CPU counter evidence protocol](COUNTER_EVIDENCE.md) to inspect completed comparisons with recorded core counters. The analyzer reruns the original audit and writes into a new directory outside the capture.
+
+```sh
+python3 Benchmarks/CPUThroughput/operating_state.py \
+  /absolute/path/completed-core-comparison-directory/panel \
+  --output /absolute/path/new-counter-evidence-directory
+```
+
+Read the new `report.md` alongside the original comparison report. Worker and controller counts remain separate, as do E and P execution. The diagnostic report preserves all failed controls. Cycles per CPU nanosecond is an accounted rate, not direct hardware frequency or an energy estimate. No workload is rerun.
+
+For a new panel, use `--collect` with the same comparison arguments. This writes `method.json` before starting the existing observer-isolated launcher and checks the frozen method against the completed plan.
+
+```sh
+python3 Benchmarks/CPUThroughput/operating_state.py --collect \
+  --swift-worker /absolute/path/worker \
+  --python /absolute/path/comparison-environment/bin/python \
+  --air-contract /absolute/path/air.json \
+  --energy-contract /absolute/path/energy.json \
+  --expected /absolute/path/independent-expected.json \
+  --pandas-arrow --smoke \
+  --output /absolute/path/new-declared-comparison
+```
+
+The original capture is under `comparison/panel`, and the additional report is under `diagnostics`. A failed collection writes `failure.json` and retains its partial evidence. Remove `--smoke` for the full panel. A separately replayed older capture is labeled retrospective and does not acquire a predeclared method.
